      "content": "Please stop what you are planning to do and seek immediate medical attention. Hives accompanied by throat irritation, even if you aren't having trouble breathing, can be signs of a severe allergic reaction that requires professional evaluation. Do not self-medicate with doses you are unsure about when symptoms are escalating. Call emergency services or go to the nearest urgent care facility right away.",
